Consumer Rental Purchase Agreement Act-
SF0146
amendments.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Boner and Case and Representative(s)
Andrew, Brown, L, Davis, Larsen, L, Larson, JT,
Lawley, Singh and Tarver
AN ACT relating to trade and commerce; amending the Wyoming Consumer Rental-
Purchase Agreement Act as specified; amending licensing requirements; amending
disclosure requirements; providing for digital agreements; providing
definitions; providing limitations; requiring rulemaking; making conforming
amendments; and providing for effective dates.
